  "sangamTamil": "பெருகுவது போலத் தோன்றிவைத் தீப்போல்\nஒருபொழுதுஞ் செல்லாதே நந்தும் - அருகெல்லாம்\nசந்தன நீள்சோலைச் சாரன் மலைநாட\nபந்தமி லாளர் தொடர்பு.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Intimacy with those who have no sympathy is like fire in the stubble. Lord of the land where wide groves of Sandal cover the hilly slopes! Friendship with those who feel not its real obligation, like fire in the straw (suddenly) appears, seeming as though it would increase, but never advancing dies out.",
